        "original_id": "72337aa4-c76b-5227-b7b5-c27f628d7be9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tahmoh Penikett, Joss Whedon\n- Characters: Karl C. Agathon (Helo)\n- Organizations: Mutant Enemy Productions, Bellwether Pictures\n- Television series: Supernatural, Dollhouse, Continuum, Buffy the Vampire Slayer, Angel, Firefly, Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D., Battlestar Galactica\n\nFacts:\n- From 1997 to 2003, Joss Whedon was the creator of the television series \"Buffy the Vampire Slayer.\"\n- From 1999 to 2004, Joss Whedon was the creator of the television series \"Angel.\"\n- In 2002, Joss Whedon created the television series \"Firefly.\"\n- From 2009 to 2010, Joss Whedon created the television series \"Dollhouse.\"\n- Tahmoh Penikett starred in the TV series \"Supernatural,\" Joss Whedon's \"Dollhouse,\" and the Showtime time travel show \"Continuum.\"\n- In the re-imagined \"Battlestar Galactica\" TV series, Tahmoh Penikett portrayed the fictional character Karl C. Agathon, also known by the callsign \"Helo.\"\n- From 2013, Joss Whedon was the creator of the television series \"Agents of S.H.I.E.L.D.\"\n- Joss Whedon founded Mutant Enemy Productions and co-founded Bellwether Pictures.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
